  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Funding to support procurement of essential commodities and services in conflict affected regions of Northern Ethiopia. - Ethiopia (01-Oct-2024-30-Sep-2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia, Multicomponent, United Nations Children&apos;s Fund (UNICEF Ethiopia)This program has the following goals: To support critical emergency fund response in the conflict affected areas in Tigray, Amhara, Afar and Oromia, between October 2024 and September 2025. The objectives of this program are: To contribute to restoring TB, HIV and Malaria response in conflict affected areas in Northern Ethiopia.  To complement the efforts of Federal Ministry of Health</narrative>
  </description>
